@baseUrl = http://localhost:7777
@accessToken = replace-with-local-test-token

### Visão geral tab: level progress, constância and the achievements summary
GET {{baseUrl}}/gamification/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Achievements tab: level, XP and the merged achievement catalog
GET {{baseUrl}}/gamification/achievements
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Calendário tab: one month of practice-day states and streak context
GET {{baseUrl}}/gamification/calendar?year=2026&month=9
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Calendário tab: a future month is rejected with 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/gamification/calendar?year=2099&month=1
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Histórico de XP tab: every grant for the account, newest concession first
GET {{baseUrl}}/gamification/xp-history
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Activity result reward band: this attempt's confirmed Activity XP
@activityId = replace-with-local-activity-id
@attemptId = replace-with-local-attempt-id
GET {{baseUrl}}/gamification/activities/{{activityId}}/attempts/{{attemptId}}/xp-reward
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
